    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, shoot, bounce, &amp; whip your way through colorful worlds and dangerous obstacles!!!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/713c16823639ed6399920b863ebe0275.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of D-MAN, an undead acrobat, as he aids Death herself in collecting souls. This is all in an effort to help is new friend Sprite, a small alien butterfly, collect the Trinity Heart shards to save her home planets from an oncoming war!!!! It won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/987320bbddecefebb9c694fc68bac897.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/65c989490a05e41f8b2499a79f0814fe.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse strange, mysterious, and COLORFUL worlds full of challenging platforming goodness! D-MAN is quick on his feet, but also easy to stumble! Keep up the pace in each stage to form a rhythm to get you through safe and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/17a19ac59b95919456acc200f6a2e1aa.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, D-MAN won't be alone in his endeavors! Encounter weird and quirky characters to help piece together this mess!!!!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/56633861a18b237665a5bc929ed5f718.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D-MAN is versatile!!! Keep exploring to unlock new abilities!!!! There's more than one way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/a1aa61116b1507edf8e5e9b5abc8872a.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/f694980db917a663e294828f722f62a8.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be doing a lot of tricky maneuvers to get through each stage!!! Although D-MAN is more than equipped... will he be enough???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, shoot, bounce, &amp; whip your way through colorful worlds and dangerous obstacles!!!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/713c16823639ed6399920b863ebe0275.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of D-MAN, an undead acrobat, as he aids Death herself in collecting souls. This is all in an effort to help is new friend Sprite, a small alien butterfly, collect the Trinity Heart shards to save her home planets from an oncoming war!!!! It won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/987320bbddecefebb9c694fc68bac897.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/65c989490a05e41f8b2499a79f0814fe.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse strange, mysterious, and COLORFUL worlds full of challenging platforming goodness! D-MAN is quick on his feet, but also easy to stumble! Keep up the pace in each stage to form a rhythm to get you through safe and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/17a19ac59b95919456acc200f6a2e1aa.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, D-MAN won't be alone in his endeavors! Encounter weird and quirky characters to help piece together this mess!!!!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/56633861a18b237665a5bc929ed5f718.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D-MAN is versatile!!! Keep exploring to unlock new abilities!!!! There's more than one way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/a1aa61116b1507edf8e5e9b5abc8872a.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/f694980db917a663e294828f722f62a8.avif?t=1744351567\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be doing a lot of tricky maneuvers to get through each stage!!! Although D-MAN is more than equipped... will he be enough???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
